  "observations": [
    "Initial public read source gate passed, but initial workflow execution passed 2 functions and failed 3: incomplete literal TD map trailers blocked writes, and the synthetic encryption-add setup was itself unsupported before the intended refusal call.",
    "A fixture-only grammar correction supplied genuine TWO-FF trailers, declared lengths and free geometry. A deterministic supported encrypted source now authenticates and reads exact rows before the encrypted-write refusal. Production admission and expected write behavior were not relaxed.",
    "The first two strict checks stopped on one engine conditional style warning, then CLI precedence/enum naming warnings. Explicit clap names retain the same public commands; no warnings were suppressed.",
    "Publication review found missing caller-side output-byte accounting. The final unit set includes one-below/exact quota checks before temp creation; final actual CLI workflows pass again after the correction.",
    "Temporary integration inputs/outputs are asserted inside tests and removed with their temp directories. This record does not claim independently retained complete candidate images or original-file/native Access replay.",
    "Final source pins include post-check formatter-only module ordering and whitespace changes.",
    "The documentation TSV example spells its empty NULL data field as quoted empty text, preserving the same parsed value without trailing whitespace."
